@CsvDataProcessor.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5152

### Get sample customer data
GET {{CsvDataProcessor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/csv/sample

### Export customer data to CSV
POST {{CsvDataProcessor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/csv/export
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": "CUST-001",
    "fullName": "Alice Smith",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0100",
    "balance": 1500.50,
    "isActive": true,
    "registeredDate": "2025-06-15T00:00:00Z"
  }
]
